        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>I also notify you, my lord, that the basket with the glassware and the five bottles</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>are with the n\u0101khud\u0101 A\u1e25mad {read: Mu\u1e25ammad}, the n\u0101khud\u0101 of the ship of the Fidy\u0101r; on all of them</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>is written &lsquo;Yiju&rsquo; in Hebrew letters. The hide</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and the bottle of sugar are with Sheikh Abu \u02bel-\u1e24asan al-Ma\u1e25all\u012b, and</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>the silk is with the elder Ab\u016b \u02bfAl\u012b b. \u1e6cayyib. Please, my lord, take delivery</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>of all this, which is in the Fidy\u0101r&rsquo;s ship&mdash;may God ordain its safety!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>May God, the Exalted, unite you with us in His mercy and compassion! And Peace.</p>\n</li></ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
