          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, address, left column",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>(From) His servant, who is longing</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>for him, Khalaf b.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Isaac&mdash;may he be remembered for resurrection!</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
